ach line of input contains no more than 1024 characters (the maximum number of characters per line, excluding the line terminator character). The input is terminated by a line containing \"#\" in column 1.\n\nOutput:\n\nFor each input line, compute the CRC value of the message contained in the line and write the numerical value of the CRC bytes (in hexadecimal notation) onto an output line. Note that each printed CRC value should be between 0 and 34942 (in decimal).\n\nSample Input:\n\n```\nthis is a test\nA\n#\n```\n\nSample Output:\n\n```\n77 FD\n00 00\n0C 86\n```\n\n## Input and Output Samples\n\n### Sample Input #1\n\n```\nthis is a test\nA\n#\n```\n\n### Sample Output #1\n\n```\n77 FD\n00 00\n0C 86\n```\n```\n\nThe input will be given via stdin and the output should be printed to stdout by your code.\n\nNow solve the problem by providing the code.\n","content_sha256":"195cd5a944d31cec9cc3f548ea261182f8b0a1c3b200c77c28c776c0d3e5a6ef","end_byte":3137,"end_line":58,"parent_chunk_id":"CH-CURSOR-f09c364f9151ecf2","parent_chunk_sha256":"195cd5a944d31cec9cc3f548ea261182f8b0a1c3b200c77c28c776c0d3e5a6ef","selection_basis":"complete","snapshot_sha256":"195cd5a944d31cec9cc3f548ea261182f8b0a1c3b200c77c28c776c0d3e5a6ef","source_ref":"TASK.md","span_id":"OBS-SPAN-b1867d53f63fe968eacb","start_byte":0,"start_line":1}],"fact_authority":"exact_spans_only","operation":"read_file","payload_kind":"exact_utf8_spans","projection_complete":true,"projection_version":"typed-lineage-observation-funnel.v1","raw_output_bytes":3137,"raw_output_chars":3137,"raw_output_sha256":"195cd5a944d31cec9cc3f548ea261182f8b0a1c3b200c77c28c776c0d3e5a6ef","raw_result_persisted":true,"raw_result_sha256":"17f3ba6a515f03f75f4d918c43846c63fe3c9bffd7d86a5616dc4ccf6ae1e3a2","schema_version":"rwkv-lh.observation-packet.v1","source_artifact":{"fact_authority":"harness_file_artifact_identity","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"TASK.md","sha256":"195cd5a944d31cec9cc3f548ea261182f8b0a1c3b200c77c28c776c0d3e5a6ef","